# Build-time working directories and outputs created by Build-MsixPackage.ps1.
# obj/ holds the intermediate `dotnet publish` output, the makepri inputs and the staged
# package layout; dist/ holds EasyAkuru.msix plus the exported .cer (-Sign) or the
# .msixupload (-StoreUpload). Both are regenerated by re-running the script.
obj/
dist/
